The shell is consistent, while each workspace should look and behave like the professional instrument it represents. Use a restrained dark engineering theme, clear technical typography, tabular numeric values, and consistent units. Avoid generic admin dashboards, oversized KPI cards, decorative meters, excessive whitespace, and non-functional controls.

